<title>UK: Telewest says mulls NTL approach.</title>
<headline>Telewest says mulls NTL approach.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>British cable TV company Telewest Communications Plc confirmed on Monday it had been approached by Nasdaq-listed NTL Inc about a joint deal and said it was considering the proposal.</p>
<p>But the company stressed that any talks were at a very early stage.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been an approach and we are looking at it as we look at any other approach,&quot; a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
</text>
